{"id":"p-gen-44-19","reference":"Gen.44.19","sourceId":"wlc-oshb","sourceText":"הֲ/יֵשׁ־לָ/כֶ֥ם אָ֖ב אוֹ־אָֽח","display":"הֲיֵשׁ־לָכֶם אָב אוֹ־אָח","translation":"Do you have a father or a brother?","tokens":[{"id":"01pr1","hebrew":"הֲ/יֵשׁ","lemma":"i/3426","morph":"HTi/Tm","gloss":"is there?"},{"id":"01Fd5","hebrew":"לָ/כֶ֥ם","lemma":"l","morph":"HR/Sp2mp","gloss":"to you"},{"id":"01tVx","hebrew":"אָ֖ב","lemma":"1","morph":"HNcmsa","gloss":"a father"},{"id":"01Kgz","hebrew":"אוֹ","lemma":"176 a","morph":"HC","gloss":"or"},{"id":"01Z7W","hebrew":"אָֽח","lemma":"251","morph":"HNcmsa","gloss":"a brother"}],"notes":"Hebrew has no word for 'have' here; it says 'is there to you'. You can already pick out two words on this line.","questionIds":[],"requires":["alphabet","rtl"]},
{"id":"p-gen-1-1","reference":"Gen.1.1","span":"verse","sourceId":"wlc-oshb","sourceText":"בְּ/רֵאשִׁ֖ית בָּרָ֣א אֱלֹהִ֑ים אֵ֥ת הַ/שָּׁמַ֖יִם וְ/אֵ֥ת הָ/אָֽרֶץ׃","display":"בְּרֵאשִׁית בָּרָא אֱלֹהִים אֵת הַשָּׁמַיִם וְאֵת הָאָרֶץ׃","translation":"In the beginning God created the heavens and the earth.","tokens":[{"id":"01xeN","hebrew":"בְּ/רֵאשִׁ֖ית","lemma":"b/7225","morph":"HR/Ncfsa","gloss":"in the beginning"},{"id":"01Nvk","hebrew":"בָּרָ֣א","lemma":"1254 a","morph":"HVqp3ms","gloss":"he created"},{"id":"01TyA","hebrew":"אֱלֹהִ֑ים","lemma":"430","morph":"HNcmpa","gloss":"God"},{"id":"01vuQ","hebrew":"אֵ֥ת","lemma":"853","morph":"HTo","gloss":"object marker"},{"id":"01TSc","hebrew":"הַ/שָּׁמַ֖יִם","lemma":"d/8064","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa","gloss":"the heavens"},{"id":"01k5P","hebrew":"וְ/אֵ֥ת","lemma":"c/853","morph":"HC/To","gloss":"and, object marker"},{"id":"01nPh","hebrew":"הָ/אָֽרֶץ","lemma":"d/776","morph":"HTd/Ncbsa","gloss":"the earth"}],"notes":"Translation is original to this game. The syntax of the first word is long debated.","questionIds":["gen-1-1-a","gen-1-1-b","gen-1-1-c"],"requires":["genesis-reading"]},
{"id":"p-gen-1-2","reference":"Gen.1.2","span":"verse","sourceId":"wlc-oshb","sourceText":"וְ/הָ/אָ֗רֶץ הָיְתָ֥ה תֹ֨הוּ֙ וָ/בֹ֔הוּ וְ/חֹ֖שֶׁךְ עַל־פְּנֵ֣י תְה֑וֹם וְ/ר֣וּחַ אֱלֹהִ֔ים מְרַחֶ֖פֶת עַל־פְּנֵ֥י הַ/מָּֽיִם׃","display":"וְהָאָרֶץ הָיְתָה תֹהוּ וָבֹהוּ וְחֹשֶׁךְ עַל־פְּנֵי תְהוֹם וְרוּחַ אֱלֹהִים מְרַחֶפֶת עַל־פְּנֵי הַמָּיִם׃","translation":"Now the earth was formless and empty, and darkness lay over the surface of the deep, and the wind or spirit of God was hovering over the surface of the waters.","tokens":[{"id":"01LN3","hebrew":"וְ/הָ/אָ֗רֶץ","lemma":"c/d/776","morph":"HC/Td/Ncbsa","gloss":"now the earth"},{"id":"01Qzf","hebrew":"הָיְתָ֥ה","lemma":"1961","morph":"HVqp3fs","gloss":"was"},{"id":"01aPd","hebrew":"תֹ֨הוּ֙","lemma":"8414","morph":"HNcmsa","gloss":"formless"},{"id":"01eYX","hebrew":"וָ/בֹ֔הוּ","lemma":"c/922","morph":"HC/Ncmsa","gloss":"and empty"},{"id":"01C5U","hebrew":"וְ/חֹ֖שֶׁךְ","lemma":"c/2822","morph":"HC/Ncmsa","gloss":"and darkness"},{"id":"01qNN","hebrew":"עַל","lemma":"5921 a","morph":"HR","gloss":"over"},{"id":"01EVS","hebrew":"פְּנֵ֣י","lemma":"6440","morph":"HNcbpc","gloss":"surface of"},{"id":"01PB6","hebrew":"תְה֑וֹם","lemma":"8415","morph":"HNcbsa","gloss":"the deep"},{"id":"0137c","hebrew":"וְ/ר֣וּחַ","lemma":"c/7307","morph":"HC/Ncbsc","gloss":"and the wind or spirit of"},{"id":"01x9c","hebrew":"אֱלֹהִ֔ים","lemma":"430","morph":"HNcmpa","gloss":"God"},{"id":"01yNB","hebrew":"מְרַחֶ֖פֶת","lemma":"7363 b","morph":"HVprfsa","gloss":"hovering"},{"id":"0129t","hebrew":"עַל","lemma":"5921 a","morph":"HR","gloss":"over"},{"id":"01KZG","hebrew":"פְּנֵ֥י","lemma":"6440","morph":"HNcbpc","gloss":"surface of"},{"id":"01TZE","hebrew":"הַ/מָּֽיִם","lemma":"d/4325","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa","gloss":"the waters"}],"notes":"Waw on a noun gives background. The wind-or-spirit reading isn't settled here on purpose.","questionIds":["gen-1-2-a","gen-1-2-b","gen-1-2-c"],"requires":["genesis-reading"]},
{"id":"p-gen-1-3","reference":"Gen.1.3","span":"verse","sourceId":"wlc-oshb","sourceText":"וַ/יֹּ֥אמֶר אֱלֹהִ֖ים יְהִ֣י א֑וֹר וַֽ/יְהִי־אֽוֹר׃","display":"וַיֹּאמֶר אֱלֹהִים יְהִי אוֹר וַיְהִי־אוֹר׃","translation":"And God said, let there be light, and there was light.","tokens":[{"id":"01thY","hebrew":"וַ/יֹּ֥אמֶר","lemma":"c/559","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms","gloss":"and he said"},{"id":"01JM7","hebrew":"אֱלֹהִ֖ים","lemma":"430","morph":"HNcmpa","gloss":"God"},{"id":"01fpo","hebrew":"יְהִ֣י","lemma":"1961","morph":"HVqj3ms","gloss":"let there be"},{"id":"01W26","hebrew":"א֑וֹר","lemma":"216","morph":"HNcbsa","gloss":"light"},{"id":"01yw4","hebrew":"וַֽ/יְהִי","lemma":"c/1961","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms","gloss":"and there was"},{"id":"01jbg","hebrew":"אֽוֹר","lemma":"216","morph":"HNcbsa","gloss":"light"}],"notes":"A wish, and then the same verb in a narrative form reporting that it came true.","questionIds":["gen-1-3-a","gen-1-3-b"],"requires":["genesis-reading"]},
{"id":"p-gen-1-4","reference":"Gen.1.4","span":"verse","sourceId":"wlc-oshb","sourceText":"וַ/יַּ֧רְא אֱלֹהִ֛ים אֶת־הָ/א֖וֹר כִּי־ט֑וֹב וַ/יַּבְדֵּ֣ל אֱלֹהִ֔ים בֵּ֥ין הָ/א֖וֹר וּ/בֵ֥ין הַ/חֹֽשֶׁךְ׃","display":"וַיַּרְא אֱלֹהִים אֶת־הָאוֹר כִּי־טוֹב וַיַּבְדֵּל אֱלֹהִים בֵּין הָאוֹר וּבֵין הַחֹשֶׁךְ׃","translation":"And God saw that the light was good, and God separated the light from the darkness.","tokens":[{"id":"01USR","hebrew":"וַ/יַּ֧רְא","lemma":"c/7200","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms","gloss":"and he saw"},{"id":"01v6U","hebrew":"אֱלֹהִ֛ים","lemma":"430","morph":"HNcmpa","gloss":"God"},{"id":"015SS","hebrew":"אֶת","lemma":"853","morph":"HTo","gloss":"object marker"},{"id":"01GzE","hebrew":"הָ/א֖וֹר","lemma":"d/216","morph":"HTd/Ncbsa","gloss":"the light"},{"id":"01qCU","hebrew":"כִּי","lemma":"3588 a","morph":"HC","gloss":"that"},{"id":"01g2y","hebrew":"ט֑וֹב","lemma":"2896 a","morph":"HAamsa","gloss":"good"},{"id":"01jQb","hebrew":"וַ/יַּבְדֵּ֣ל","lemma":"c/914","morph":"HC/Vhw3ms","gloss":"and he separated"},{"id":"01794","hebrew":"אֱלֹהִ֔ים","lemma":"430","morph":"HNcmpa","gloss":"God"},{"id":"01CsU","hebrew":"בֵּ֥ין","lemma":"996","morph":"HR","gloss":"between"},{"id":"01XR4","hebrew":"הָ/א֖וֹר","lemma":"d/216","morph":"HTd/Ncbsa","gloss":"the light"},{"id":"01KvS","hebrew":"וּ/בֵ֥ין","lemma":"c/996","morph":"HC/R","gloss":"and between"},{"id":"01dBc","hebrew":"הַ/חֹֽשֶׁךְ","lemma":"d/2822","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa","gloss":"the darkness"}],"notes":"The translation folds 'saw the light, that it was good' into natural English.","questionIds":["gen-1-4-a","gen-1-4-b"],"requires":["genesis-reading"]},
{"id":"p-gen-1-5","reference":"Gen.1.5","span":"verse","sourceId":"wlc-oshb","sourceText":"וַ/יִּקְרָ֨א אֱלֹהִ֤ים ׀ לָ/אוֹר֙ י֔וֹם וְ/לַ/חֹ֖שֶׁךְ קָ֣רָא לָ֑יְלָה וַֽ/יְהִי־עֶ֥רֶב וַֽ/יְהִי־בֹ֖קֶר י֥וֹם אֶחָֽד׃ פ","display":"וַיִּקְרָא אֱלֹהִים ׀ לָאוֹר יוֹם וְלַחֹשֶׁךְ קָרָא לָיְלָה וַיְהִי־עֶרֶב וַיְהִי־בֹקֶר יוֹם אֶחָד׃ פ","translation":"And God called the light day, and the darkness he called night. And there was evening, and there was morning: day one.","tokens":[{"id":"01nAB","hebrew":"וַ/יִּקְרָ֨א","lemma":"c/7121","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms","gloss":"and he called"},{"id":"01kfX","hebrew":"אֱלֹהִ֤ים","lemma":"430","morph":"HNcmpa","gloss":"God"},{"id":"01Wkf","hebrew":"לָ/אוֹר֙","lemma":"l/216","morph":"HRd/Ncbsa","gloss":"the light, marked with 'to'"},{"id":"01wrL","hebrew":"י֔וֹם","lemma":"3117","morph":"HNcmsa","gloss":"day"},{"id":"013TL","hebrew":"וְ/לַ/חֹ֖שֶׁךְ","lemma":"c/l/2822","morph":"HC/Rd/Ncmsa","gloss":"and the darkness, marked with 'to'"},{"id":"01LeN","hebrew":"קָ֣רָא","lemma":"7121","morph":"HVqp3ms","gloss":"he called"},{"id":"01sMn","hebrew":"לָ֑יְלָה","lemma":"3915","morph":"HNcmsa","gloss":"night"},{"id":"01Y3z","hebrew":"וַֽ/יְהִי","lemma":"c/1961","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms","gloss":"and there was"},{"id":"01NQN","hebrew":"עֶ֥רֶב","lemma":"6153","morph":"HNcmsa","gloss":"evening"},{"id":"01uLf","hebrew":"וַֽ/יְהִי","lemma":"c/1961","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms","gloss":"and there was"},{"id":"01kA7","hebrew":"בֹ֖קֶר","lemma":"1242","morph":"HNcmsa","gloss":"morning"},{"id":"013TS","hebrew":"י֥וֹם","lemma":"3117","morph":"HNcmsa","gloss":"day"},{"id":"01NFp","hebrew":"אֶחָֽד","lemma":"259","morph":"HAcmsa","gloss":"one"}],"notes":"Hebrew has the cardinal 'one' where English translations often say 'first'. Source text keeps the paseq and the paragraph mark.","questionIds":["gen-1-5-a","gen-1-5-b"],"requires":["genesis-reading"]}
